OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for #15bn rebuild of nuclear
OL,4,Aweapons factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a mega, hi-tech #15bn rebuild
OL,7,Fof a nuclear weapons factory are set to
OL,8,Fbe submitted to the local planning
OL,9,Fauthority.
OL,11,FThe main planned development for the
OL,12,FAtomic Weapons Establishment (AWE) in
OL,13,FAldermaston, Berkshire, is the
OL,14,Fmulti-billion-pound Future Materials
OL,15,FCampus, a major long-term construction
OL,16,Fprogramme to replace aging 1950s-1970s
OL,17,Ffacilities.
OL,19,FAn outline planning application is
OL,20,Fexpected to be submitted to West
OL,21,FBerkshire Council in late 2026.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
