OL,4,Aweapons factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority has to give planning
OL,7,Fpermission for the huge new complex,
OL,8,Fwhich effectively rebuilds the nuclear
OL,9,Fbomb factory, according to the Local
OL,10,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
